  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\"><head><title>요청 내용 확인 · 작은손 커피공방</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/littlehands/app.3539de012f0c.css\"></head>\n<body data-app=\"little-hands\" data-environment=\"staging\"><header class=\"site-header\" data-native-key=\"site-header\" data-native-type=\"surface\"><div class=\"wrap header-inner\"><div class=\"brand\" data-native-key=\"brand-stack\"><a class=\"brand-link\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"작은손 커피공방 홈\" data-native-key=\"brand\" data-native-type=\"control\" data-action=\"home\">작은손 커피공방</a><small data-native-key=\"brand-tagline\" data-native-type=\"text\">커피를 배우는 작은 시간</small></div><nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"회원 메뉴\"><a href=\"/\" data-action=\"sessions\" data-native-key=\"nav-sessions\" data-native-type=\"control\">수업 둘러보기</a><a href=\"/bookings/\" data-action=\"bookings\" data-native-key=\"nav-bookings\" data-native-type=\"control\">나의 예약</a><a href=\"/notifications/\" data-action=\"notifications\" data-native-key=\"nav-notifications\" data-native-type=\"control\">알림 12</a><form inert data-export-only=\"true\" method=\"post\"><button class=\"text-button\" data-action=\"logout\" data-native-key=\"nav-logout\" data-native-type=\"control\" type=\"button\">로그아웃</button></form></nav></div></header>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"page \" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"auth\"><p class=\"kicker\" data-native-key=\"booking-conflict-p-1-0\" data-native-type=\"text\">요청을 완료하지 못했습니다</p><h1 data-native-key=\"conflict-title\" data-native-type=\"text\">요청을 확인해 주세요.</h1><div class=\"error-summary\" role=\"alert\" data-native-key=\"conflict-message\" data-native-type=\"surface\"><p data-native-key=\"booking-conflict-p-2-0\" data-native-type=\"text\">이미 취소된 예약입니다.</p></div><p data-native-key=\"booking-conflict-p-4-0\" data-native-type=\"text\">현재 정보를 확인한 뒤 새로 신청해 주세요. 같은 요청을 그대로 다시 전송하지 않아도 됩니다.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/bookings/20a1fb73-757b-464d-b9fb-98057fedf35d/\" data-a